# 10. Hardware / Deployment Considerations

The standard SGLang quickstart currently recommends Linux and NVIDIA GPUs with CUDA for the common setup, while SGLang also documents support paths for other hardware platforms.

Therefore, the core project should not depend on SGLang running locally on every developer laptop.

Recommended strategy:

```text
                 Development
                      |
          +-----------+-----------+
          |                       |
          v                       v
   Without SGLang             With SGLang
          |                       |
   Synthetic events        Real inference
          |                       |
          +-----------+-----------+
                      |
                      v
             Same Cost Engine
             Same Risk Engine
             Same Policy Engine
             Same Digital Twin
```

This keeps the project fully demoable even if the local machine does not have suitable hardware.

