# 15. Final Positioning

The strongest way to describe the integration is:

> **SGLang provides the inference infrastructure; Denial of Wallet provides the economic security layer.**

SGLang makes model inference fast and scalable.

Denial of Wallet asks a different question:

> **"Should this agent be allowed to keep spending at this rate?"**

That distinction is the heart of the project.

Final system:

```text
             AUTONOMOUS AI AGENT
